<title>RUSSIA: Foreigners to get 25 pct of Russia Svyazinvest.</title>
<headline>Foreigners to get 25 pct of Russia Svyazinvest.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia will sell a 25 percent stake in telecoms company Svyazinvest to foreign investors and offer 24 percent to domestic investors, telecommunications minister Vladimir Bulgak told a news conference.</p>
<p>He said on Wednesday that a presidential decree on the sale was likely in February.</p>
</text>
